    "sentence_translations": [
      "(8) Buy One Get One Free",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi walks to the front of the milk tea store. There are no cats here now, and also no Gao Ming.",
      "Gao Ming is not here.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi is a little unhappy. She goes inside the milk tea store.",
      "",
      "The person at the milk tea store says, “Hello, what would you like to drink?”",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi says, “Hello, I would like a cup of milk tea.”",
      "",
      "“Sure, a large?”",
      "",
      "“Yes, a large, thanks.”",
      "",
      "“Today is Saturday. Our store is doing buy one get one free,” the person at the milk tea store says.",
      "",
      "“Buy one get one free?” Leng Xiaoxi asks.",
      "",
      "“Yes, you buy a cup of milk tea, and we can give you another cup for free,” the person at the milk tea store says.",
      "",
      "“I … but … two cups is too much. I can’t drink two cups by myself,” Leng Xiaoxi says."
    ]
